anwar alemara portal report

we are using odbc library for make the connection with sap b1

here is the connection credential
connectionString =
    'DRIVER={HDBODBC};SERVERNODE=hanab2:30015;UID=SYSTEM;PWD=B1admin!;CHAR_AS_UTF8=1';

you can see an ex how the connection made via src/api/duedateusers 

if you are facing an issue in the sql query when try to get data you should add to the sql 
the db name beside each for ex

this way not acceptable

    FROM "ORCT" T0
        INNER JOIN "OCRD" T1 ON T1."CardCode" = T0."CardCode"

it should be like this 

   FROM "ALUMARAH_LIVE"."ORCT" T0
        INNER JOIN "ALUMARAH_LIVE"."OCRD" T1 ON T1."CardCode" = T0."CardCode"

so all sql query should add to it the db name like the structure above

